{
  "$comment": [
    "Exact versions of everything vendored into a build. Committed; the",
    "binaries themselves never are - CI builds them from these pins and",
    "uploads them as artefacts. Changing a pin is a pull request with a",
    "reason, and it re-runs the parity check in docs/adr/spikes/loom-native.md."
  ],
  "loom": {
    "repo": "https://github.com/ad-freiburg/loom",
    "commit": "1e4757838104d1e4d22186c9b77d5fc4b98681a0",
    "note": "Head of master on 2026-09-07. The published maps were built from an unpinned master build; the spike checks whether that output matches this commit.",
