    "licence": "PSF-2.0 (CPython); MPL-2.0 (the project's build scripts)",
    "licence_check": "Verified 2026-09-07: the interpreter links libedit, not GNU readline, and _dbm links only libSystem - no GDBM. Both are GPL components that must stay out; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. The Windows asset, listed 2026-09-12, has no readline and no _dbm or _gdbm extension; darwin-x64 has the same names as darwin-arm64."
